{"seq":1,"slug":"computer-science","title":"计算机科学与技术","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/university/engineering/computer-science","introMarkdown":"# 计算机科学与技术 简介\n\n计算机科学与技术探讨的核心问题是：如何用形式化的方法描述计算过程，并在物理硬件上高效地实现它。这门学科横跨从晶体管到分布式系统的多个抽象层次，每一层都有其独特的思维方式和待解决的挑战。\n\n对于自学者而言，计算机科学的魅力在于它既有严谨的数学根基，又有极强的实践导向。你可以在纸上推导算法的时间复杂度，也可以立刻在终端里运行代码验证自己的想法。这种\"理论与实验零距离\"的特性，使它成为最适合自主探索的工科领域之一。\n\n本学习空间按照从基础到前沿的脉络，将计算机科学划分为四个章节。**第一章 程序设计基础** 从数据结构与算法出发，帮助你建立用代码解决问题的核心能力，同时理解不同编程范式背后的设计哲学。**第二章 系统架构** 深入操作系统、计算机网络和数据库这三大系统软件，它们构成了几乎所有现代应用的运行基座。**第三章 计算理论** 转向更抽象的视角，探讨自动机、形式语言和计算复杂性等基础问题，这些理论决定了\"什么是可计算的\"这一根本边界。**第四章 前沿技术** 聚焦人工智能、分布式计算和网络安全等当下最活跃的研究方向，展示计算机科学如何持续拓展自身的应用疆域。\n\n建议从第一章开始顺序学习，因为后续章节会频繁用到前面建立的概念。如果你已有编程经验，可以直接从第二章切入，按兴趣在系统与理论之间灵活跳转。无论选择哪条路径，动手写代码、做实验始终是理解这门学科最有效的方式。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"programming-foundations","title":"程序设计基础","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/engineering/computer-science/programming-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"programming-paradigms","title":"大学计算机科学与技术 — 编程范式","url":"/education/university/engineering/computer-science/programming-foundations/programming-paradigms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-structures-algorithms","title":"大学计算机科学与技术 — 数据结构与算法","url":"/education/university/engineering/computer-science/programming-foundations/data-structures-algorithms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"programming-languages","title":"大学计算机科学与技术 — 编程语言设计与实现","url":"/education/university/engineering/computer-science/programming-foundations/programming-languages"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"systems-architecture","title":"系统架构","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/engineering/computer-science/systems-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"operating-systems","title":"大学计算机科学与技术 — 操作系统","url":"/education/university/engineering/computer-science/systems-architecture/operating-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"computer-networks","title":"大学计算机科学与技术 — 计算机网络","url":"/education/university/engineering/computer-science/systems-architecture/computer-networks"},{"seq":3,"slug":"computer-architecture","title":"大学计算机科学与技术 — 计算机体系结构","url":"/education/university/engineering/computer-science/systems-architecture/computer-architecture"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"theory-of-computation","title":"计算理论","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/engineering/computer-science/theory-of-computation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"automata-theory","title":"大学计算机科学与技术 — 自动机理论","url":"/education/university/engineering/computer-science/theory-of-computation/automata-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"computational-complexity","title":"大学计算机科学与技术 — 计算复杂性","url":"/education/university/engineering/computer-science/theory-of-computation/computational-complexity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"formal-languages","title":"大学计算机科学与技术 — 形式语言","url":"/education/university/engineering/computer-science/theory-of-computation/formal-languages"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"emerging-technologies","title":"前沿技术","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/engineering/computer-science/emerging-technologies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"artificial-intelligence","title":"大学计算机科学与技术 — 人工智能","url":"/education/university/engineering/computer-science/emerging-technologies/artificial-intelligence"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cloud-computing","title":"大学计算机科学与技术 — 云计算","url":"/education/university/engineering/computer-science/emerging-technologies/cloud-computing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cybersecurity","title":"大学计算机科学与技术 — 网络安全","url":"/education/university/engineering/computer-science/emerging-technologies/cybersecurity"}]}]}